*1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A complete joke of a stage.

The Mistress Celeboodles and Wild Doges spawn frequently enough to provide you with more than enough cash throughout the fight, and the behemoth threats spawn significantly later than the Wicked Face.

Having [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] makes this stage completely free, since every enemy here (barring the Mistress Celeboodle) is either an aku or a behemoth enemy, both traits which he thrives against. If you're worried about the Wild Doges, bring along [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]], who will deal with them as well as the Crustaceous Scissorex very well. Your goal for this stage is to, well, there's no special goal here. Kill all three behemoth threats, and you'll win. [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] can be added in as support, but is ultimately unnecessary.

As for meatshields, [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone]] works well enough to stall all of the threats, while [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] can stall and damage the Scissorex.

